I don't if this has been posted before, but yesterday I tried to 
run the 286 version of nethack 3.1.1 on a xt-system with a V20 processor
(instead of the 8088), and it works fine. That is to say, it runs, but 
very slowly. Creating a new level takes about two to three minutes, and one 
move about two seconds. But I have a very slow XT (4.77MHz), so if you have 
a V20 running at 10MHz... The price of a V20 (or V30 as a replacement for
the 8086) is not that high, so....

Good luck, XT-owners, try it !!!



